            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Madan, Juhi; Bolen, Bennett; Yang, Emily; Zuñiga, Mikel; Erikkson, Albert; Backman, Adam; Stjernberg, Johan; Skoog, Marcus; Sjöberg, Axel. (2020). Creating Value From Waste as Part of a Sustainable Future\r\n. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: https://purl.stanford.edu/dw947kz5195",
            "type": "preferred citation",
